{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08011","headline":"行路难三首 二 · 李白","name":"行路难三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道如青天，我独不得出。\n羞逐长安社中儿，赤鸡白狗赌梨栗。\n弹劒作歌奏苦声，曳裾王门不称情。\n淮阴市井笑韩信，汉朝公卿忌贾生。\n君不见昔时燕家重郭隗，拥篲折节无嫌猜。\n剧辛乐毅感恩分，输肝剖胆效英才。\n昭王白骨萦烂草，谁人更扫黄金台。\n行路难，归去来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}